{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wwIm4DsBfu1795730550.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。此外，覆蓋該區的雲帶預料會在今日轉薄。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：初時部分時間多雲。日間漸轉天晴，市區最高氣溫約25度，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩北至東北風。</p><p></p><p>展望：週末期間至下週初大致天晴。星期六非常乾燥。星期日風勢頗大。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T23:04:20.919018+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T22:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T01:57:15.896350+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T22:57:33.533505+00:00","content_hash":"62ce7752c676b3188c590371c126281651a5336edf72e2e93cb64bea1a0c597e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T23:04:20.919018+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}